Author: missingbulb <73882448+missingbulb@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Sat Sep 26 03:09:02 2026 +0300

    PlanNG: leave the mouse cursor to the browser (#905)

    The planner swapped the cursor for a hand, a grab, a resize arrow, a copy
    mark or a help mark across its controls and calendar. Its own 32 cursor
    declarations are removed, and the ones it inherits from plan.css are reverted
    to the browser's for this page only, so /plan/ keeps its cursors. New leaf
    19.11 compares every element's cursor with the one the browser gives it
    with the page's stylesheets off.


    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01E77Vq2uqKwAq59UVUKTiqS

    Co-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>

