    PlanNG: draw a contested hour's rivals at their own times beside the card (#902)

    A narrow lane beside the draft's pick draws each show it beat, as a dashed
    bar from that show's own start to its own end, packed side by side up to
    three rows. Past that there are too many to tell apart, so the lane becomes
    one wash down the pick's slot, darkest where the most shows overlap, with a
    count on top. Resting on the lane, or clicking it, opens the hour's list:
    our pick first, and each other show lockable in its place. The original pick
    gets no verdict. Replaces the stacked cards. Spec 20.2, 20.3, 20.15.

